// 71 SWATCH CANDIDATES from the owner's list — object-form themes rendered
// via themeCss(object); NOTHING here ships until picked. `needs` records
// capabilities the engine lacks for the full look; the swatch still shows
// the palette and type honestly. Structural items 74-81 of the list are the
// layout layer, not themes, and are deliberately absent. Editorial and Glass
// are already shipped in THEMES and join the sweep from there.
//
