// (≤0.375rem or ≥0.875rem — the 8-12px middle is where every card reads the
// same), and every theme declares its component treatment where the genre has
// one: `buttons` pill/sharp, `inputs` underline/filled, and the new `offset`
// shadow for the drawn-block genres. Same rule as the shipped set: components
// must change with the theme, not just the paint.
